{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RegexProtocol"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"matchAllFull"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"string","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnsafePointer"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gchar","text":"gchar","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">!, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"stringLen"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gssize","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gssize"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"startPosition"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"matchOptions","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"RegexMatchFlags","preciseIdentifier":"s:4GLib15RegexMatchFlagsV","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/RegexMatchFlags","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"matchInfo","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sp","text":"UnsafeMutablePointer","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnsafeMutablePointer","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sp"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"GMatchInfo","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">?>! = nil) "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This function uses a different algorithm (called DFA, i.e. deterministic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finite automaton), so it can retrieve all the possible matches, all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"starting at the same point in the string. For instance matching","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"\"<a> <b> <c>\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" against the pattern ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"<.*>\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"you would obtain three matches: ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"<a> <b> <c>\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"\"<a> <b>\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"<a>\""},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The number of matched strings is retrieved using","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_match_info_get_match_count()"},{"text":". To obtain the matched strings and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their position you can use, respectively, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_match_info_fetch()"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_match_info_fetch_pos()"},{"text":". Note that the strings are returned in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reverse order of length; that is, the longest matching string is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"given first."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that the DFA algorithm is slower than the standard one and it","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is not able to capture substrings, so backreferences do not work.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Setting "},{"code":"startPosition","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" differs from just passing over a shortened","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"string and setting "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"notbol"},{"text":" in the case of a pattern","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that begins with any kind of lookbehind assertion, such as “\\b”."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unless ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"raw"},{"text":" is specified in the options, ","type":"text"},{"code":"string","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must be valid UTF-8.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/MatchInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" structure, used to get information on the match, is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stored in ","type":"text"},{"code":"matchInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if not ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":". Note that if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"matchInfo"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" then it is created even if the function returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"i.e. you must free it regardless if regular expression actually","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matched.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"string","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not copied and is used in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/MatchInfo","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" internally. If","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you use any "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/MatchInfo","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" method (except ","type":"text"},{"code":"g_match_info_free()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") after"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"freeing or modifying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"st